Date: Wed, 4 Mar 2026 17:44:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] patch-17: Chat Audio Inbound

Accept audio attachments in webchat chat.send, save via saveMediaBuffer,
transcribe via audio-preflight pipeline, and pass MediaPath/MediaUrl
in MsgContext so the agent receives the transcript as text input.

Adds extractAudioAttachments() to chat-attachments.ts with audio/*
MIME detection and browser video/webm alias handling.
---
 src/gateway/chat-attachments.ts    | 57 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/gateway/server-methods/chat.ts | 44 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

